# AWS source lock

Do not invent Greengrass V2 / IoT Core CLI flags, discovery URLs, or pricing from memory.

1. Prefer facts in `.kiro/steering/aws-source-lock.md`.
2. Else link docs.aws.amazon.com (use aws-docs MCP when available).
3. Mark unverified steps explicitly until an evidence pass.

When editing `docs/**`, re-check claims before finishing the change.
